{"id":"n71688-4-7","stage":1,"title":"이기다 · 支撑","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71688-4-7-1","ko":"이기지도 못할 술을 왜 그렇게 마셨니?","zh":"明明酒量不好，为什么喝这么多？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이기지도","meaning":"支撑","explanation":"이기다：支撑；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"이기다","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71688","senseId":"4","lemma":"이기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이기지도","audio":"/audio/15ff6d87216b0a738d2b.mp3"}},{"text":"못할","meaning":"不会","explanation":"못하다：不会；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"못하다","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91168","senseId":"1","lemma":"못하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못할","audio":"/audio/eef6a7842f8a78a64c06.mp3"}},{"text":"술을","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술을","audio":"/audio/8bbc7232261087ddd88e.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그렇게","audio":"/audio/b470a873a66143d27846.mp3"}},{"text":"마셨니?","meaning":"喝，饮","explanation":"마시다：喝，饮；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"마시다","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64682","senseId":"1","lemma":"마시다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마셨니","audio":"/audio/120aa236d5b4baa1bccb.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"f623afa3b5ca8273","term":"이기다","zh":"支撑","audio":"/audio/f623afa3b5ca8273fc1e.mp3","entryId":"71688","definition":"将身体挺直或扶正。","pronunciation":["이기다"]},{"id":"641e1150cc79b5b2","term":"못하다","zh":"不会","audio":"/audio/641e1150cc79b5b24a33.mp3","entryId":"91168","definition":"做某事做不到一定水准或没有做此事的能力。","pronunciation":["모ː타다"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3","entryId":"65157","definition":"像啤酒或烧酒等那样含有酒精成分、喝后会醉的饮料。","pronunciation":["술"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"dbfc687cbb29318d","term":"마시다","zh":"喝，饮","audio":"/audio/dbfc687cbb29318d3ccd.mp3","entryId":"64682","definition":"使水等液体流入喉咙。","pronunciation":["마시다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a6e5083e158aae85e616.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71688-4-7-2","ko":"오늘 여자 친구와 헤어졌어.","zh":"今天和女朋友分手了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"여자","meaning":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","explanation":"여자：女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","readings":[{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27369","senseId":"1","lemma":"여자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여자","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3"}},{"text":"친구와","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；와：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구와","audio":"/audio/c93e8af68adb1e2b77e3.mp3"}},{"text":"헤어졌어.","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어졌어","audio":"/audio/6bf41306eb7af5c3d147.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"3109db6ce062c863","term":"여자","zh":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","audio":"/audio/3109db6ce062c8633018.mp3","entryId":"27369","definition":"女性（여자 친구 合指“女朋友”）","pronunciation":["여자"]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f39a3ab83126509e422.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71688","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5707,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天和女朋友分手了。","字写得也太小了啊。","明明酒量不好，为什么喝这么多？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天和女朋友分手了。","明明酒量不好，为什么喝这么多？","字写得也太小了啊。"],"answer":0}]}
